{"path":"experimental/simd/memory_alignment","title":"std::experimental::memory_alignment","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>memory_alignment","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/simd/memory_alignment","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"If is_simd_mask_v<T> is true and U is bool, or if is_simd_v<T> is true and U is a vectorizable type, provides the member constant value equal to the minimum alignment of a pointer passed to a load constructor, copy_from function, or…","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/simd\">&lt;experimental/simd&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> U <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> T<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value_type</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> memory_alignment<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-parallelism-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(parallelism TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code>is_simd_mask_v&lt;T&gt;</code> is <code>true</code> and <code>U</code> is <code>bool</code>, or if <code>is_simd_v&lt;T&gt;</code> is <code>true</code> and <code>U</code> is a vectorizable type, provides the member constant <code>value</code> equal to the minimum alignment of a pointer passed to a load constructor, <code>copy_from</code> function, or <code>copy_to</code> function. For any other types <code>T</code> and <code>U</code>, there is no member <code>value</code>. \n</p><